+charged-inputs.sha256                         frozen-input manifest
+control-axis/axis_exact.py                    exact pair-algebra evaluator
+control-axis/axis_exact_t2_t7.json            every coefficient/norm/resultant
+control-axis/axis_exact_t2_t7.out             validation log
+coeff-exact-axis.py                           independent exact implementation
+axis-t2-t7.jsonl                              independent full output
+axis-record-validation.out                    exact t=2..5 comparison log
+selected-norm-summary.tsv                     compact selected norm index
+control-axis/t2_fibre15.sing/.out             exact Singular negative control
+```
+
+The only Singular job initiated by this lane was foregrounded with `timeout`
+and completed.  No lane job was left running.

